sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as External Client
    participant REST as REST Gateway<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant GRPC as gRPC Runtime<br/>8085/TCP gRPC
    participant TGIS as TGIS Server<br/>configurable/TCP gRPC
    participant HFModel as HuggingFace Model<br/>(in-memory GPU/CPU)
    participant HFHub as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant GPU as GPU (PyTorch)
    participant FS as Local Filesystem

    rect rgb(232, 244, 253)
        Note over Client,HFModel: Flow 1: Local Model Inference
        Client->>REST: POST /api/v1/task/text-generation<br/>HTTP, Optional TLS, Platform Auth
        REST->>GRPC: Forward request<br/>gRPC, localhost (no TLS)
        GRPC->>HFModel: Run inference<br/>(model loaded in GPU/CPU memory)
        HFModel-->>GRPC: Prediction result
        GRPC-->>REST: gRPC response<br/>localhost
        REST-->>Client: JSON response<br/>HTTP, Optional TLS
    end

    rect rgb(254, 243, 199)
        Note over Client,TGIS: Flow 2: Remote TGIS Inference
        Client->>REST: POST /api/v1/task/text-generation<br/>HTTP, Optional TLS, Platform Auth
        REST->>GRPC: Forward request<br/>gRPC, localhost
        GRPC->>TGIS: GenerationTaskRequest<br/>gRPC, Optional TLS/mTLS
        TGIS-->>GRPC: GenerationResponse<br/>gRPC, Optional TLS/mTLS
        GRPC-->>REST: gRPC response<br/>localhost
        REST-->>Client: JSON response<br/>HTTP, Optional TLS
    end

    rect rgb(220, 252, 231)
        Note over Client,FS: Flow 3: Model Training (Prompt Tuning)
        Client->>GRPC: Training request<br/>gRPC 8085, Optional TLS, Platform Auth
        GRPC->>HFHub: Download base model<br/>HTTPS 443, TLS 1.2+, API token
        HFHub-->>GRPC: Model artifacts
        GRPC->>GPU: Fine-tune with PEFT<br/>PyTorch, prompt tuning
        GPU-->>GRPC: Trained prompt vectors
        GRPC->>FS: Save .pt artifact<br/>Local filesystem
        GRPC-->>Client: Training result<br/>gRPC, Optional TLS
    end

    rect rgb(237, 233, 254)
        Note over Client,REST: Flow 4: Embedding / Reranking
        Client->>REST: POST /api/v1/task/embedding<br/>HTTP, Optional TLS
        REST->>GRPC: Forward request<br/>gRPC, localhost
        Note right of GRPC: SentenceTransformers<br/>model in memory<br/>(optional IPEX accel)
        GRPC-->>REST: Embedding vector(s)
        REST-->>Client: JSON response
    end
